+    // --- GPR <-> VSR move (major opcode 31, XX1-form) ---
+    //
+    // Two sub-encodings:
+    //   mtvsr* XT,RA{,RB}: XX1Form — XT at bits 25:21 (5) + TX at bit 0 (1);
+    //                      RA at bits 20:16; RB (if any) at bits 15:11.
